# Session-decision scoring — test drive, not a construction.
#
# Proves discrimination for SessionDecisionScoringShape, closing the session-
# level half of the gap SilentGapShape already closes at the individual
# work-item level, per BP-D10's own real discipline (RICE+DepFactor,
# extracted from the OE knowledge base, not reconstructed from memory).
#
# RS_NoScore: 3 candidates considered, no score named -> fires.
# RS_TwoOnly: 2 candidates considered, no score named -> silent (below the
#   BP-D10 trigger of 3+; a two-way choice is not the anti-pattern this
#   shape exists to catch).
# RS_Backed: 3 candidates considered, a real RICEScore named -> silent.

@prefix backlog: <http://example.org/backlog#> .
@prefix ex:      <http://example.org/sessionscore#> .
@prefix xsd:     <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

ex:BL a backlog:Backlog ; backlog:hasIdentifier "BL-SS" ; backlog:hasState backlog:Proposed .

ex:RS_NoScore a backlog:RegisterSession ; backlog:sessionFor ex:BL ;
    backlog:consideredOptionCount 3 .

ex:RS_TwoOnly a backlog:RegisterSession ; backlog:sessionFor ex:BL ;
    backlog:consideredOptionCount 2 .

ex:RS_Backed a backlog:RegisterSession ; backlog:sessionFor ex:BL ;
    backlog:consideredOptionCount 3 ; backlog:decisionBackedByScore ex:Score_Backed .
ex:Score_Backed a backlog:RICEScore ; backlog:scoredByMethod backlog:Method_RICE ;
    backlog:hasReach 10.0 ; backlog:hasImpact 2.0 ; backlog:hasConfidence 0.8 ; backlog:hasEffort 1.5 ;
    backlog:hasScoreValue 10.667 ; backlog:hasScoreRationale "Fixture-only: matches this session's own real RICEScore-for-RICEScore case." .
